    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75336" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὄρπα:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐρινύς,</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Hsch.
		</span></i> (Cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὄριψα.</span>) <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρπαξ:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρασὺς ἄνεμος,</span> Id. (prob. 
			Aeol.
		 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅρπαξ</span>). <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄρπας:</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἀκρίδος ὁ γόνος</span> (i. e. young
		locusts, 'hoppers'), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνθεν γάρον
		ποιοῦσιν,</span> Id.</div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
